# Vitest failure screenshots — derived, per-run, never reviewed. Deliberately NOT where the VRT
# baselines live: apps/e2e/stories/__vrt__ is tracked, because a baseline nobody can see in a diff
# proves nothing to anyone but the machine that ran it. Keeping the two apart is the whole point —
# 40 failure PNGs once sat in this directory and read as if this repo had VRT. It did not.
